{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0433_1000_p", "source_sha256": "d1bf12e65f0a8b1884d340e46c9930b2dd9bd2027395dbe180d2858adc6abf98", "ja": "（今日はグラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』の撮影だ。真も\n衣装に着替え、いつものように気合いを……あれ？）", "zh": "（今天要拍摄写真杂志《偶像写真！！》。真也换好了衣服，正像往常一样干劲十足地准备着……咦？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0433_1001_006mak", "source_sha256": "51798278b12ebed5c437bb3a22166f25ca8802c338a250d4a0efb79e67e0ab33", "ja": "ふわわ～ん……。\nふあ～ん。ふよ～ん。ふやゆよ～ん……。", "zh": "软绵绵～……\n呼啊～嗯。飘呀～。呼呀呦～……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0433_1002_p", "source_sha256": "18499be5c1009173818c0e764d3a182df85182927a851263d5f767c5399ae05b", "ja": "ま、真？　何をしてるんだ？", "zh": "真、真？你这是在做什么呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0433_1003_006mak", "source_sha256": "6064c2dec7e07c87fdc18e3842f8b95ed6da0bcf2fb8902852d55f84fa46e788", "ja": "あ、{$P$}。\nへへっ、これはボクが考えたリラックス法ですよ～。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}。\n嘿嘿，这是我想出来的放松方法哦～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0433_1004_006mak", "source_sha256": "eb8053b8361343847f82d56f21f1bdd652ba17689f4e5a3463615cdb97e5de5f", "ja": "今日のテーマは『パジャマでリラックス』ですからね。\nできるだけ気をユルめておきたくて～。", "zh": "今天的主题是“穿着睡衣放松”，所以嘛。\n我想尽可能让自己放松下来～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0433_1005_p", "source_sha256": "2183dbe322cf035e421b6e16661a3a53d391ad866556414c4bc5d9910afb334c", "ja": "なるほど……？　まぁ、たしかに、\nさっきの声を出してたら力は抜けそうだな。", "zh": "原来如此……？嗯，说得也是，刚才那样喊一嗓子，确实感觉能放松下来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0433_1006_006mak", "source_sha256": "f344aa5717a40e3485936ee0e99a46c0b8d1293a6a05b2eb876f08c20cd9b78f", "ja": "そうですよね～。空手なんかで気合いを入れるときは、\n思いっきり声を出してたなーと思って……。", "zh": "就是这样呢～。想起以前练空手道之类、鼓足干劲的时候，都会尽情喊出声来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0433_1007_006mak", "source_sha256": "a766517adde2068c8b74d966c3f84d9135f08d6e443690f6d6e65e6614a715c4", "ja": "逆に、ほよ～んとか、ふわわ～んとか、ユルい言葉を\n言ってみたら、結構力が抜けるんですよ～……。", "zh": "不只是运动的时候，感觉也能用在时尚搭配上，对吧？要是你喜欢的话，我也会很开心的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0433_1008_p", "source_sha256": "4e32f63fcf1800b153c8423623122f0904fa35de10cf638a732e608b76943d28", "ja": "空手の応用だったのか。真ならではの方法だな。\nところで真、今日の撮影プランなんだが……。", "zh": "原来是空手道的应用啊。这还真是只有真才会用的方法。对了，真，关于今天的拍摄计划……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0433_1009_006mak", "source_sha256": "a806d7901ca26bdf0fe55f40370d035b57c84ad797f438e316440ac21d882bbc", "ja": "本番の話ですか？　イメージはバッチリ\nできてますから、任せてくださいっ！　押忍っ！", "zh": "是说正式拍摄吗？我已经完全想好要呈现的形象了，交给我吧！押忍！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0433_1010_006mak", "source_sha256": "865204560eadb1291c124f7590feecc9768f57f7903398f4f8328cbc558aed67", "ja": "……って、しまったあ！\nいつもの調子で、気合い入れちゃいましたっ！", "zh": "……糟糕！一不小心又像平时那样打起精神来了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0433_1011_p", "source_sha256": "1f1c1b6de0090500172306225f7db303e142d7934097c9702f4b615fbe786b1e", "ja": "だ、大丈夫だ。まだ撮影まで時間はある。\nそれまでに、しっかりリラックスしておけばいいさ。", "zh": "没、没事。离拍摄还有时间。\n在那之前，好好放松一下就行了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0433_1012_006mak", "source_sha256": "7a52843b5fce438d97311005c300401ba32da23819d89cb699ae1acf3c473336", "ja": "は、はい……。でも、今みたいに\nウッカリ気合いを入れちゃいそうで怖いなあ……。", "zh": "是、是……可是，我有点害怕自己会像刚才那样，一不小心又鼓起干劲……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0433_1013_006mak", "source_sha256": "ca94b5757fe8cec16f1a4630bf31e8d4917b77df28a279da8808f75adf54c712", "ja": "そうだ、もしよかったら{$P$}も\n一緒に声を出してもらえませんか？", "zh": "对了，如果可以的话，能请{$P$}也一起喊出来吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0433_1014_p", "source_sha256": "a1023262605d6611ea26a1b2250ac3d803f818611c972616796369947bc8dab5", "ja": "え、一緒に？", "zh": "咦，要一起？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0433_1015_006mak", "source_sha256": "8b4aafc22cce01b2bb27e04408b50d1827488b8de857c9e7fe015e2e3cb140c0", "ja": "目の前で{$P$}がリラックスしてたら\nボクも忘れずに気をユルめ続けられると思うので！", "zh": "如果{$P$}能在我面前放松下来，\n我想我也能一直不忘放松心情！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0433_1016_p", "source_sha256": "8c09fd647734966ffbaf668faa69a6486e492466c55d190eb868ce01b41faa14", "ja": "そ、そういうことなら。\nふよ～ん。ぷよよ～ん……こんな感じでいいか？", "zh": "既然、既然是这样。\n呼哟～。噗哟哟～……像这样就可以了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0433_1017_006mak", "source_sha256": "2c99998af5fdb8c2eb3253cecba87b4c3e1ca38fa1302a5d88eebe82cf7bb6a1", "ja": "わっ、いいですね、{$P$}！\nすっごく力が抜ける感じがします！　よーしボクも！", "zh": "哇，很不错呢，{$P$}！\n感觉整个人都放松下来了！好——我也来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0433_1018_006mak", "source_sha256": "c30695781fb928b429a502a45eeb591a61c3715dd5b6cecb371f02f9cf7270f3", "ja": "ふわわ～……。ふよよ～。ぽわ～ん。", "zh": "软绵绵～……。飘悠悠～。轻飘飘。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0433_1019_p", "source_sha256": "22c75ad29dd406f3dce655a607889571fd7f76c3fca23ddb219bdfe1256117d1", "ja": "（真のためとはいえ少し恥ずかしくなってきたけど……\nこの調子なら、撮影もうまくいくはずだ！）", "zh": "（虽然这一切都是为了真，但也开始觉得有点不好意思了……照这个势头，拍摄应该也能顺利进行！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
